{"id":"n1-058","title":"Noun にして (Noun ni shite)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the idea 'even for', 'even though', or 'in spite of'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point Noun にして expresses a sense of surprise, disbelief or unexpectedness in response to a situation or circumstance. Generally, it is used when the speaker wants to convey that something is unexpected even for someone (noun) or in their situation.","formation":"Noun + にして","examples":[{"jp":"彼は医者にしてその基本的な知識がないのが信じられない。","romaji":"Kare wa isha ni shite sono kihonteki na chishiki ga nai no ga shinjirarenai.","en":"I can't believe that even as a doctor, he doesn't have that basic knowledge.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"医者","vocabId":"1159980","reading":"いしゃ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"基本","vocabId":"1219190","reading":"きほん"},{"surface":"的","vocabId":"1437260","reading":"てき"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"知識","vocabId":"1420590","reading":"ちしき"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"信じ","vocabId":"1359040","reading":"しんじる","baseForm":"信じる"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"られる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"彼は経験豊富な運転手にして、事故を起こした。","romaji":"Kare wa keiken houfu na untenshu ni shite, jiko wo okoshita.","en":"Even as an experienced driver, he had an accident.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経験","vocabId":"1251270","reading":"けいけん"},{"surface":"豊富","vocabId":"1518180","reading":"ほうふ"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"運転","vocabId":"1172830","reading":"うんてん"},{"surface":"手","vocabId":"1327190","reading":"て"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"事故","vocabId":"1313850","reading":"じこ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"起こし","vocabId":"1223660","reading":"おこす","baseForm":"起こす"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9]},{"jp":"彼は成績優秀な生徒にして、その問題が解けなかった。","romaji":"Kare wa seiseki yuushuu na seito ni shite, sono mondai ga tokenakatta.","en":"Even as an excellent student, he couldn't solve that problem.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成績","vocabId":"1375760","reading":"せいせき"},{"surface":"優秀","vocabId":"1539230","reading":"ゆうしゅう"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"生徒","vocabId":"1379380","reading":"せいと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"解け","vocabId":"1198910","reading":"とける","baseForm":"解ける"},{"surface":"なかっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8]},{"jp":"彼は勉強家にして、その問題を理解できなかった。","romaji":"Kare wa benkyouka ni shite, sono mondai o rikai dekinakatta.","en":"Even as a studious person, he could not understand that problem.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","voca